WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.003
This is Cloudflare Starter: a small app your agents can use.

2
00:00:08.003 --> 00:00:18.002
The demo is the starter itself.

3
00:00:18.002 --> 00:00:28.006
Sign-in, workspaces and billing are already done.

4
00:00:28.006 --> 00:00:38.004
An agent asks for access. You allow it.

5
00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:48.002
It works in your app, as you.

6
00:00:48.002 --> 00:00:58.004
Invite your team.

7
00:00:58.004 --> 00:01:08.005
Plans and limits are built in.

8
00:01:08.005 --> 00:01:18.002
Admin, health and logs: solved.

9
00:01:18.002 --> 00:01:25.001
It all runs on the $5 Cloudflare plan.

10
00:01:25.001 --> 00:01:30.000
Clone it and ship.
